<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 21.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the Mid-session of monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at 12:00pm was 4116.50, 8.31 points or 0.20 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
<p>   STOCK		Weightage Percent	Percent</p>
<p>			  %	  change in    change in</p>
